  "body": "Auction: 497 Pakuranga Road, Highland Park (Branch office) on Tuesday 8 December 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nUnpack your bags in this potential packed, spacious 1970s family home, quietly nestled at the end of a tranquil cul-de-sac. Whether you’re searching for your next step on the property ladder or seeking a secure haven for your family, this inviting residence offers abundant promise and versatility.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Features:\r\n• Three generous double bedrooms, one common bathroom/toilet plus a separate toilet\r\n• Spacious open plan lounge and dining areas, modern kitchen\r\n• Light-filled conservatory for relaxed living\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow - perfect for entertaining and family gatherings\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers a self-contained one-bedroom suite with its own living area. Ideal for extended family, guests, homestays, or an independent teen.\r\n\r\nSet on a substantial 612m² (mol) of elevated, family-friendly land, this property also boasts a freestanding carport and ample off-street parking. Spacious backyard great for vege gardens and outdoor activities.\r\n\r\nA Smart Investment for the Future. Zoned Residential – Mixed Housing Suburban, with easy access to wastewater and stormwater services. The potential for development is yours to explore (subject to council approval).\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of Pak’n Save supermarket, Highland Park shops, public transport, parks, and beautiful local beaches just moments away. Zoned for highly regarded schools — Macleans Primary, Howick Intermediate, and Pakuranga College — within short distance away makes it an easy choice to stay and raise your family.\r\n\r\nGet in before Christmas. With motivated overseas vendor committed to a sale, now is the perfect time to secure your future.\r\n\r\nPlease visit us at the open homes or contact us today to arrange a private viewing.",
